{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261125/photo/bkn-20261125054638277-1125_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261125060831\"/><p>警員圍封現場調查。(梁國雄攝)</p><p>今日(25日)清晨5時23分，執法部門接獲報案，指一名中年男子昏迷倒臥在北角長康街10號對開馬路。救援人員到場將事主送往律敦治醫院救治，現場路中遺下一攤血漬。據了解，警員正循事主疑從高處墮下或遇車禍方向調查事件。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T22:24:20.849807+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T21:46:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T22:17:44.311575+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T22:17:44.311575+00:00","content_hash":"c9e57b6a1dae3df0beb4846a86032903b05822f011618a21177e0c3b67e88677","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}